{"unit_id": "tag:03OF:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有一个抽象的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）概念，定义在赋环景（ringed site）上。这里简要介绍。更多信息请参阅《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》节<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的对象（object）。则<MATH_0004>表示范畴（category），由<MATH_0005>上方的对象（objects）组成，见《范畴（Categories）》例<REF_0002>。若<MATH_0006>是景（site），则<MATH_0007>也是景（site），即覆盖（coverings），对于<MATH_0008>，是族（families）<MATH_0009>，由态射（morphisms）组成，属于<MATH_0010>且具有固定目标（target），使得<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的覆盖（covering）。此外，给定任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0013>，定义在<MATH_0014>上，其<TEXTITOPEN_0001>限制（restriction）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0015>（以显然的方式定义）也为层（sheaf）。细节见《景（Sites）》节<REF_0003>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "赋环景"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "赋环景", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": 