{"unit_id": "tag:03OJ:statement", "translation": "关于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的元定理（Meta theorem）<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是景（site）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 底层范畴（underlying category）<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的满子范畴（full subcategory），\n<STRUCT_0003> 任意扎里斯基覆盖（Zariski covering），对于<MATH_0005>，都可细化（refined）为覆盖（covering），属于<MATH_0006>，\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0007>是<MATH_0008>的对象（object），\n<STRUCT_0005> 每个覆盖（covering），属于<MATH_0009>，都是fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），由概形（schemes）组成。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n则预层（presheaf）<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>上的层（sheaf），且任意拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0012>-模（module），定义在<MATH_0013>上，都具有形式<MATH_0014>，对于某个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0015>，定义在<MATH_0016>上。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Meta theorem", "target_term": "元定理"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴"}, {"source_term": "full subcategory", "target_term": "满子范畴"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refined", "target_term": "细化"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Meta theorem", "target_term": "元定理", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"