{"unit_id": "tag:03OJ:proof", "translation": "经过一些形式论证，这正是定理<REF_0001>。细节略去。在《下降（Descent）》命题<REF_0002>中，证明该定理的更精确版本，对于大（big）扎里斯基（Zariski）、fppf、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）、光滑（smooth）及句法（syntomic）景（sites），属于<MATH_0001>，以及小（small）扎里斯基（Zariski）及平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（sites），属于<MATH_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03OF:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n换言之，拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent modules），定义在概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>上，与拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0002>-景上的模（modules on sites），景为定理中的<MATH_0003>，之间没有差别。对于大（big）和小（small）景（sites）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>等的更精确陈述，可见《下降（Descent）》节<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>及<REF_0003>。本章有时将提及“定理<REF_0004>中的景（site）”，以便方便地陈述在那些情形中任一个都成立的结果。\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules on sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "modules on sites", "target_term": "景上的模", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}], "notes": []}
