{"unit_id": "tag:03OK:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n接下来的目标是使用下降（descent）理论，证明<MATH_0001>，对于所有拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）<MATH_0002>，定义在<MATH_0003>上，以及任意景（site）<MATH_0004>，如定理<REF_0001>中所述。为此，引入切赫（<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech）景上的上同调（cohomology on sites）。更多细节见<REF_0002>及《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》节<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>及<REF_0005>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech", "target_term": "切赫"}, {"source_term": "cohomology on sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech", "target_term": "切赫", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "cohomology on sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调", "context": "拟凝聚层与切赫上同调；译法待批准。"}], "notes": []}
